@startuml oid4vp_components_ko
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam padding 4

actor "사용자" as user

rectangle "월렛" {
    component "인가앱\n- request_uri 조회\n- Request Object 서명 검증\n- 응답 전송" as ca
    component "Wallet SDK\n- DCQL 매칭\n- VP Token 생성\n- 응답 본문(JWE) 생성" as sdk
}

component "Verifier 서버\n- Request Object 제공\n- response_uri" as verifier
database "신뢰저장소\n(DID Document)" as repo

user -right-> ca
ca -down-> sdk : 매칭 · VP Token 생성
ca -right-> verifier : Request Object 조회\nVP Token 전송
ca --> repo : Verifier DID Document 조회
@enduml

'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

@startuml oid4vp_seq_presentation_ko
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"
<style>
participant {
  Padding 20
}
</style>
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 400

actor "**사용자**" as user
box 월렛 #OldLace
    participant "**인가앱**" as ca <<App>>
    participant "**Wallet SDK**" as sdk <<SDK>>
end box
participant "**Verifier 서버**" as vf <<Server>>
participant "**신뢰저장소**" as repo <<Storage>>

== 월렛 호출 ==
vf -> user: QR 또는 딥링크\nopenid4vp://?request_uri=...
user -> ca: QR 스캔 또는 딥링크 실행

== Authorization Request 조회 및 검증 ==
ca -> vf ++: GET request_uri
return Request Object (서명된 JWT)
ca -> repo: Verifier DID Document 조회 (kid)
ca -> ca: Request Object 서명 검증

== Credential 매칭 ==
ca -> sdk ++: dcql_query
return 매칭 결과

== 사용자 동의 및 인증 ==
ca -> user: 제출할 Credential 및 Claim 표시
user -> ca: 동의 및 인증 (PIN 또는 생체)

== VP Token 생성 및 응답 전달 ==
ca -> sdk ++: VP Token 생성 요청
sdk -> sdk: 형식별 제출 데이터 생성\n(client_id, nonce 바인딩)
return 응답 본문\n(direct_post / direct_post.jwt)
ca -> vf ++: POST response_uri
return HTTP 2xx
@enduml
